     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><i>D-RUG</i> is a different group, which we are meeting weekly this quarter on Wednesday from 10-12pm in Shields Library (Data Science Initiative room 360).<div><br></div><div><i>Meet and Analyze Data (MAD)</i> is a data science group that is also meeting once a week. Both are excellent groups to attend, the R group focuses on R, the MAD group is more agnostic in the computer language/tools that may be discussed. </div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps,</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div><div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
